son toki ore ga super hero sa

540
00:23:26,720 --> 00:23:33,060
Quand je le ferai, je serai un super héros !

541
00:23:33,060 --> 00:23:39,100
Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!

542
00:23:33,060 --> 00:23:39,100
Cours, cours, cours ! Frappe et cours !

543
00:23:39,100 --> 00:23:45,400
moete seishun kakenukero

544
